{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41650","headline":"巫山高 · 陈陶","name":"巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉峰青云十二枝，金母和云赐瑶姬。\n花宫磊砢楚宫外，列仙八面星斗垂。\n秀色无双怨三峡，春风几梦襄王猎。\n青鸾不在嬾吹箫，斑竹题诗寄江妾。\n飘颻丝散巴子天，苔裳玉辔红霞幡。\n归时白帝掩青琐，琼枝草草遗湘烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}